{"title":"List of editors","slug":"List_of_editors","html":"<h2 id=\"editors_for_windows\">Editors for Windows</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://gonix.ten.lt/\" rel=\"noopener\">SEG</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://notepad-plus.sourceforge.net/uk/site.htm\" rel=\"noopener\">Notepad++</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.flos-freeware.ch/notepad2.html\" rel=\"noopener\">Notepad2</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://syn.sourceforge.net/\" rel=\"noopener\">Syn Text Editor</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"editors_for_os_x\">Editors for OS X</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://developer.apple.com/xcode/\" rel=\"noopener\">Xcode</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cross_platform_editors\">Cross-platform editors</h2>\n<h3 id=\"gtk\">GTK</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.gnome.org/projects/gedit/\" rel=\"noopener\">Gedit</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://geany.uvena.de/\" rel=\"noopener\">Geany</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://tarot.freeshell.org/leafpad/\" rel=\"noopener\">Leafpad</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/tsujan/FeatherPad\" rel=\"noopener\">FeatherPad</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://github.com/codebrainz/mousepad\" rel=\"noopener\">Mousepad</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"qt\">Qt</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://kate-editor.org/kate\" rel=\"noopener\">Kate</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other\">Other</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.nedit.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Nedit</a> (Windows-like)</li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.sublimetext.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Sublime Text</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.atom.io/\" rel=\"noopener\">Atom</a></li>\n<li><a data-wiki=\"SciTE\" href=\"#/library/SciTE\">SciTE</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Visual Studio Code</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.codeblocks.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Code::Blocks</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pseudographical\">Pseudographical</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://mitglied.lycos.de/albkleine/\" rel=\"noopener\">e3</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.nano-editor.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Nano</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pseudographical_graphical\">Pseudographical/graphical</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/\" rel=\"noopener\">Emacs</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://www.vim.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Vim</a></li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"editors_for_windows","text":"Editors for Windows","level":2},{"id":"editors_for_os_x","text":"Editors for OS X","level":2},{"id":"cross_platform_editors","text":"Cross-platform editors","level":2},{"id":"gtk","text":"GTK","level":3},{"id":"qt","text":"Qt","level":3},{"id":"other","text":"Other","level":3},{"id":"pseudographical","text":"Pseudographical","level":3},{"id":"pseudographical_graphical","text":"Pseudographical/graphical","level":3}],"categories":["Tools"],"rating":null,"flags":[],"words":41,"summary":"","updated":"2021-07-17","authors":["Moldu"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/List_of_editors","history":"https://wiki.osdev.org/index.php?title=List_of_editors&action=history","backlinks":[{"t":"Getting Started","s":"Getting_Started"}],"lessons":[]}